Submit the digest as plain text in this response: call no tools, add no preamble, and begin directly with `## Goal`. Do not mention where the covered range starts or ends, the compaction process, or input boundary markers such as `{{ progress_heading }}`. Write EXACTLY these five sections, each opened by its heading on its own line:
