## Remaining — {% if ctx.scope == "agent" %}threads that earlier digests left open and are still unfinished{% else %}unfinished threads, open problems, and failure causes still to be addressed{% endif %} (write "none" only if nothing remains).
## Evidence — references to crucial tool outputs a future turn can read back, one per line, like `- results__read_tool_output(invocation_id='<id>', tail=200): what it contains`; omit this section if no large output matters.
